								<span id="lblHtml"><font size="2">I borrowed this information from another site for those of us that are flag confused.<BR><BR>"In most cases just showing for a kill won`t get you a flag. There are NPC`s you have to talk to before and after killing bosses. So read up and enjoy.<BR><BR>The downloaded version is a much easier read, but I posted it out incase they take it down. download here: mywebpages.comcast.net/ma...0Flags.doc<BR><BR>P.S. I take no credit for this. Just found it to be usefull, enjoy<BR><BR>Tier 1 Planes<BR><BR><BR>Plane of Knowledge<BR>Access: Default<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Box of Souls<BR>Find Borik Darkanvil, ask about Box of Souls<BR>Collect Block of Prelium (rare from Plane of Innovation mobs), Crystaline Spider Brain (from crystal spiders in Plane of Valor), and An Agony Mephit Heart (from Agony Mephit).<BR>Either give these items to Borik with 3000pp or combine them with hammer and water in forge (trivial at 250 skill).<BR>Receive Box of Souls<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Tranquility<BR>Access: Level 46+<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Thelin&#8217;s Torment<BR>Speak with Adroha Jezith, following dialog (get flag)<BR>Speak with Thelin Poxbourne in Plane of Nightmare with 3 groups.<BR>Defeat the Maze, killing Construct of Nightmares at the end.<BR>Receive flag to enter Crypt of Terris Thule<BR><BR>Alder`s Request<BR>Speak with Alder Fuirstel, following dialog (get flag)<BR>Journey into Plane of Disease, battle through the castle, and defeat Grummus<BR>Return to Alder, who asks you to speak with Elder Fuirstel.<BR>Speak with Elder, receive flag to enter Crypt of Decay<BR><BR>Saving Tylis<BR>After killing Grummus, Elder Fuirstil tells you to kill Bertoxxulous.<BR>After killing Bertox, return to receive flag to enter Saryn&#8217;s tower.<BR>Enter the tower and kill Keeper of Sorrows<BR><BR>Curing Phanti (unfinished)<BR>Collect Putrified Bubonian Bile from Rythak<BR>Give to ##### she returns purified bile and tells you to talk to an Indigo Orc in Plane of Justice<BR>Give bile to orc (requires Master of orc language), he returns it and requests 3 items. <BR>Give him Mechanical Clockwork Venom (drop in PoI), Nettling Stinger (Nettling Wraith), and Terror Matriarch Venom Sac (Terror Matriarch).<BR>Return cure for item that allows entry to Plane of Tormet<BR><BR>Plane of Innovation<BR>Access: Level 46+<BR><BR>Notable NPCs:<BR>Xanamech Nexmirthafen<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Wake the Dragon<BR><BR>Speak with Niatrim Azinok, he requests 3 items. Return to him a copper node, a bundle of super conductive wires, and an intact power cell. <BR>When you give these 3 he begins walking towards the untargetable dragon. After killing your way to the dragon, the gnome wakes it up. <BR>Kill Xanamech Nexmirthafen.<BR>Hail Niatrim to receive flag to enter Fortress Floor.<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Disease<BR>Access: Level 46+<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Grummus<BR>Rythak<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Grimror&#8217;s Collection<BR><BR>Collect 4 items from 4 named mobs in zone<BR>The four mobs are sengian, harrion, scaevian, and generian larva.<BR><BR>PH for Harrion larva = a malarian larva(not larvae like all the others, spawns near zone in a bit out near flies)<BR>PH for Generian larva = a planarian larva(again just larva, spawns east of castle east of river near pussling camps)<BR>PH for Scaevian larva = a Tsetsian Pupa(just pupa, not pupal, spawns a bit east of generian)<BR>PH for Sengian larva = tachnian caterpillars (in the north part of the zone, not single one close to zone)<BR><BR>Give the 4 parts to Grimror for a Bangle of Disease Warding which acts as a key to Crypt of Decay.<BR><BR><BR>Plane of Nightmares<BR>Access: Level 46+<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>An Agony Mephit <BR>A Nettling Wraith<BR>Terror Matriarch <BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Justice<BR>Access: Level 46+<BR><BR>Quests:<BR><BR>Trial Quest <BR><BR>Speak with Mavuin at the back of the Jail area<BR>Say &#8220;What information&#8221; (receive flag)<BR>Complete 1 of the 6 trials<BR>Speak with The Tribunal and say Mauvin (receive flag)<BR>Return to Mavuin and hail him<BR>Receive flag for Plane of Valor and Plane of Storms<BR>Tier 2 Planes<BR><BR>Plane of Valor<BR>Access: Complete Trial Quest in Plane of Justice (1 group)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Aerin&#8217;dar<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Aerin&#8217;dar&#8217;s Lair<BR>Collect Razorfiend Heart, Crystaline Spider Heart, and Planarian Larvae Heart.<BR>Hail Johon Popoah twice<BR>Go find Paralin Notion and follow dialog.<BR>Go find Master Sergeant Aaramis Daryln and follow dialog.<BR>Go back to Paralin Notion, give 3 hearts to him. <BR><BR>Collect crystalline orb piece from Luminii Crawler, one of the frogs near the bridgehouse, and one from the skellies. <BR>Return to Master Sergeant Aaramis Daryln, follow dialog<BR>Find Captain Ryglot Cupperhide, follow dialog.<BR>Give 3 orb pieces to Captain Ryglot Cupperhide, receive Orb (key to enter Aerin&#8217;dar&#8217;s lair)<BR><BR>Grenic Drere&#8217;s quest<BR>Locate Grenic Drere and follow dialog.<BR>Complete the Box of Souls quest.<BR>In Plane of Justice, defeat 3 Tormented Wraiths (near trials room). Each has a chance to spawn &#8220;an exiled soldier/trooper/officer of marr&#8221;. Hand the exiled the Box of Souls, receive box and soul stone.<BR>Give 3 soul stones to Grenic to receive Ring of Marr, which is a key to access Halls of Honor.<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Storms<BR>Access: Complete Trial Quest in Plane of Justice (1 group)<BR><BR>Quests:<BR>Wembly&#8217;s Revenge<BR>Locate Wembly the Forlorn. Follow dialog<BR>Collect 4 medalion pieces, uncommon drop from uncomon spawn Diaku Raiders.<BR>Give 4 pieces to Wembly, receive flag for Plane of Tactics.<BR><BR>Aiding Askr<BR>Collect A storm giant&#8217;s head, a beard from the ocean giants, a bone from the desert giants, and a sash from the forest giants.<BR>Locate Askr, give him the giant&#8217;s head, receive containers.<BR>Combine beard, bone, and sash in container and hand to Askr.<BR><BR>Ask What Bastion of Thunder, receive container<BR>Collect 2 of 3 medallions from named giants, combine them.<BR>Give to Askr, receive flag to enter Bastion of Thunder.<BR><BR><BR><BR>Crypt of Decay (Ruins of Lxanvom)<BR>Access: <BR>Complete Grimror&#8217;s Collection in Plane of Disease (single)<BR>Complete Alder&#8217;s Request in Plane of Tranquil (raid)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Bertoxxulous<BR><BR><BR><BR>Crypt of Terris Thule<BR>Access: Complete Thelins Torment in Plane of Tranquility (3 group)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Terris Thule<BR><BR><BR><BR>Factory Floor (Plane of Innovation sub-zone)<BR>Access: Complete Wake the Dragon in Plane on Innovation (raid)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Manaetic Behemoth<BR><BR>Quests:<BR><BR>Destroy the Behemoth<BR>Speak with Giwin Mirakon, he tells you to destroy the Manaetic Behemoth. <BR>Receive flag to enter Plane of Tactics (Drunder, Fortress of Zek) <BR><BR>Tier 3 Planes<BR><BR>Bastion of Thunder<BR>Access: Complete Aiding Askr (single)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs<BR>Karana<BR>Agnarr the Storm Lord<BR><BR><BR><BR>Halls of Honor<BR>Access:<BR>Gain access to Aerin&#8217;dar&#8217;s Lair. Kill Aerin&#8217;dar. Drop and enter Halls of Honor (raid)<BR>Complete Grenic Drere&#8217;s Quest (single)<BR><BR>Notes: Trials to complete in this zone, supposed to allow access to Temple of Marr<BR><BR><BR><BR>Temple of Marr<BR>Access: Complete Trials in Halls of honor<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Mithaniel Marr<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Tactics (Drunder, Fortress of Zek)<BR>Access:<BR>Complete Destroy Behemoth (raid)<BR>Complete Wembly&#8217;s Revenge (single)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Tallon Zek<BR>Vallon Zek<BR>Rallos Zek<BR><BR><BR>Plane of Torment<BR>Access: <BR>Defeat Terris Tule (raid)<BR>Complete Curing Phanti (single)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Saryn<BR>The Keeper of Sorrows<BR><BR><BR><BR>Tower of Solusek Ro<BR>Access: You must defeat Saryn, Mithaniel Marr, Tallon Zek, and Vallon Zek (raid)<BR><BR>Notable Mobs:<BR>Solusek Ro<BR><BR>Tier 4 Planes<BR><BR>Plane of Fire<BR><BR>Access: <BR>Defeat Solusek Ro<BR>Defeat Rallos Zek (maybe)<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Water<BR>Access: Defeat Rallos Zek<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plate of Air<BR><BR>Access: Defeat Rallos Zek<BR><BR><BR><BR>Plane of Earth<BR><BR>Access: Defeat Rallos Zek<BR><BR><BR><BR>Tier 5 Plane<BR><BR>Plane of Time<BR>No Data ." </font></span>
							
</td></tr></table>
